title: Denial Intelligence › A denial opened › Full summary: where the denial is weak
route: /denials/D-3318
intro: The short findings stay on the page. 'Full summary' in the card header opens the long version in a pop-up, as plain text that can be selected and copied: the whole thing, or one recommendation at a time.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Full summary' in the header of 'Where the denial is weak'"
process p0 "The long text for this denial is chosen\nHand-written long text when the denial has it (D-3297, D-3318, D-3306), otherwise the text for its denial type\nA line that is missing falls back to the short text"
overlay o1 "Pop-up 'Where the denial is weak, full summary'\nSub line: D-id · initials, age · payer. 'Select any part to copy it, or use Copy all.'"
process p1 "Focus moves into the text, Tab stays inside the pop-up\nThe text scrolls inside the pop-up and can be selected"

screen l1 "'What the chart shows as a whole'\nTwo short paragraphs"
screen l2 "'Findings'\nOne block per finding: severity pill, bold title, the long paragraph, 'Source: ...'"
screen l3 "'What we would do'\nNumbered 1 to N, each with a bold title and a paragraph\nA small 'Copy' button on each one"
screen l4 "'Criteria to cite'\n'Documents to attach'\n'If the payer pushes back'"

input i1 "Select text with the mouse or keyboard\nPress Ctrl or Cmd C"
click c1 "Click 'Copy all' (footer, always in view)"
process p2 "Plain text is built\nHeadings in capitals, numbered findings and recommendations"
decision d1 "Does the browser allow copying?"
process p3 "Fallback: a hidden text box and the copy command (pages opened as files)"
decision d2 "Did the fallback work?"
toast t1 "Button reads 'Copied' for 2 seconds\n(announced to screen readers)"
toast t2 "'Select the text and press Ctrl or Cmd C'"
doc dc1 "Clipboard holds the whole summary"

click c2 "Click 'Copy' on one recommendation"
process p4 "That recommendation's title and paragraph are copied\nIts own button reads 'Copied' for 2 seconds"

click c3 "Click 'Close', the X, or the dimmed area"
click c4 "Press Esc (closes only this pop-up)"
process p5 "Pop-up closes\nFocus goes back to 'Full summary'"
end e1 "Back on the denial page, nothing changed"
endx e2 "Nothing copied"

s1 --> p0 --> o1 --> p1
p1 --> l1 --> l2 --> l3 --> l4
l1 -.-> i1
l3 --> c2 --> p4 --> d1
o1 --> c1 --> p2 --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| t1 --> dc1
d1 -->|No| p3 --> d2
d2 -->|Yes| t1
d2 -->|No| t2 --> e2
o1 --> c3 --> p5
o1 --> c4 --> p5
p5 --> e1
dc1 --> e1
